<title>USA: IPO FILING - Coleman Natural Products Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Coleman Natural Products Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Coleman Natural Products Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			 NTRL.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9.50-$10/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    1.7 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.475 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  225,000 Shrs outstanding after ipo    3,352,472</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Principal Financial Securities Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  255,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Denver, Colo.,-based company says it is leading supplier in the U.S. off fresh, branded, natural beef products that have never received hormones and antibbiotics.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Capital expenditures for new facilities, redemption of Series A preferred stock, sales and marketing programs and general corporate purposes.</p>
